# Frontend rules

Read before editing `src/Frontend/`:

- Onboarding: `docs/frontend/ONBOARDING.md`
- Features catalog: `docs/frontend/FEATURE_CATALOG.md`
- Architecture: `docs/frontend/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- Shared helpers: `docs/frontend/COMMON_LIBRARIES.md`
- Add/extend features: `docs/frontend/EXTENSIBILITY_GUIDE.md`
- Full AI checklist: `docs/frontend/LLM_FEATURE_IMPLEMENTATION_RULES.md`

## Architecture

- `app/*` = routes/pages; keep thin — logic in `lib/features` + hooks
- `lib/features/*` = domain API modules; use `apiRequest` / `apiRaw` from `lib/api/http.ts`
- `lib/shared/*` must NOT import from `app/*` or `components/*`
- Authenticated UI under `app/app/*` (wrapped by `RequireAuth`)
- Dev API: browser calls `/api/v1/...` (proxied via `app/api/[...path]/route.ts`), not direct `https://localhost:7124`

## i18n (required for new UI)

- `useTranslation()` + `t('key')` for all user-visible strings
- Add keys to `i18n/locales/en.json`, `vi.json`, and `zh.json` together
- Zod: `createAuthSchemas(t)` or messages via `t()` in schema

## Reuse lib/shared — do not reinvent

```ts
import {
  formatDate,
  formatDateTime,
  formatDateTimeOrDash,
  formatBytes,
  formatCount,
  formatRelativeTime,
  isConcurrencyError,
  ApiClientError,
} from '@/lib/shared'
```

- Dates: never `toLocaleDateString()` in pages
- Mutations: `idempotent: true` when backend requires it; pass `rowVersion` when required

## Auth

- Tokens via `lib/auth/tokens.ts` + `AuthProvider`
- Login 2FA: `apiRaw` (HTTP 202); see `auth-api.ts`
- Hydrate user with `GET /users/profile` — do not duplicate user state logic

## Quality

- Minimal diff; match Tailwind + existing `Button`/`Input`
- Run `npm run typecheck` in `src/Frontend` after changes
- Update `docs/frontend/FEATURE_CATALOG.md` when adding routes/features
- Admin-only features → `src/Admin`, not Frontend
- No secrets committed; document env in `.env.example` only
